---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_DESCRIPTION } from '../consts';

import CookieConsent from '../components/CookieConsent.astro';

// Import the video file
import myVideo from '../assets/trip.mp4';

---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>

		
<!-- Google tag (gtag.js) -->
<script async src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-BBW6FGSFT0"></script>
<script>
  window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];
  function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments);}
  gtag('js', new Date());

  gtag('config', 'G-BBW6FGSFT0');
</script>

<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>🧑‍🚀 Living in London</h1>
			<p>
				the ultimate launchpad for global adventures—was a stroke of luck. With six airports at your fingertips—Heathrow, Gatwick, Stansted, Luton, City Airport, and Southend-on-Sea—the world truly feels within reach.

There’s nothing like the thrill of travel. Boarding a plane to the unknown, stepping into a new culture, tasting unfamiliar flavors, and hearing stories in accents you’ve never heard before. It’s freedom, curiosity, and discovery all rolled into one.

I believe adventure begins the moment you leave your comfort zone—and I hope this blog sparks that fire in you to chase horizons, meet the unexpected, and experience the world in all its raw, beautiful variety.

<section class="mb-10">
  <h4 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-2 text-center">🎥 My Top 3</h4>
  <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-md aspect-video mx-auto max-w-3xl">
    <video class="w-full h-full" controls>
      {/* Use the imported variable as the src */}
      <source src={myVideo} type="video/mp4" />
      Your browser does not support the video tag.
    </video>
  </div>
</section>

			<div class="flex justify-center mt-8">
  <a href="/blog" class="inline-block px-6 py-3 rounded-2xl bg-blue-100 text-current text-lg shadow-md hover:bg-blue-200 hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300 ease-in-out">
    🌍 Read the Blog
  </a>
</div>

				
		</main>

		 <CookieConsent /> 
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
